/-!
Formalization of Wang--Yan, `dimension_four_dependence.pdf`.

`DimensionFourDependence.DependenceTheorem` specifies Theorem 1.1;
`theorem_1_1` proves it in every positive degree over the original field.
`theorem_6_1` proves the nonhomogeneous ternary classification over the
original field. `theorem_1_2` uses it to prove the full original-field
tameness theorem, including one-stable tameness and ordinary tameness
through degree five.
`proposition_2_3` and `corollary_5_3_original_coordinates` give the two
generic-fiber criteria and the classification with its free scalar action.
`lemma_4_4` gives the pencil degree inequality by specialization of
the projective image at an original prime divisor.
README.md lists the paper results and the formulations used here.
Every theorem exported by this module has a complete proof.
-/
